The  driver  provides  support for USB Ethernet adapters based on
the RealTek RTL8152 USB  Fast  Ethernet  devices  including:  and
RTL8153  USB Gigabit Ethernet devices including: The RTL8152 con‐
tains an integrated Fast Ethernet MAC, which supports both 10 and
100Mbps speeds in either full or half duplex.  The RTL8153 has  a
Gigabit  Ethernet  MAC and additionally supports 1000Mbps speeds.
